{"id": "0223", "session": "component-01", "message": "请找到刚才的“验收变压器”，把容量改为120 MVA，一次侧电压改为11 kV。先让我看看修改方案，暂时不要执行。", "response": "修改方案预览已生成，**当前未执行**，模型无任何改动。\n\n## 修改方案：验收变压器 容量/一次侧电压\n\n**目标元件**：验收变压器（key=`_newTransformer_3p2w_1`，`model/CloudPSS/_newTransformer_3p2w`，canvas_0）\n\n| 项目 | 当前值 | 修改后 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Tmva（容量）** | `100` MVA | **`120` MVA** ✅ |\n| **V1（一次侧电压）** | `10` kV | **`11` kV** ✅ |\n| V2（二次侧电压）| `110` kV | `110` kV（不变）|\n| f（频率）| `50` Hz | `50` Hz（不变）|\n| 其余参数 | 默认 | 不变 |\n| 引脚 pins | `{0..5:\"\"}` | 不变（仍空、不接线）|\n| label | 验收变压器 | 不变 |\n\n**影响范围**：仅将容量 100→120 MVA、一次侧电压 10→11 kV，其余（二次侧 110 kV、频率、引脚等）均不变，不影响任何其他设备。\n\n回复 **“确认执行”** 后我再落实该修改并回读；在此之前不保存、不运行仿真。", "elapsed_s": 5.16041898727417, "pending_preview": {"operation": "update", "request": {"operation": "update", "target": {"key": "_newTransformer_3p2w_1"}, "changes": {"args": {"Tmva": 120, "V1": 11}}, "confirmation": null, "options": {}}, "plan": {"component_id": "_newTransformer_3p2w_1", "before": {"key": "_newTransformer_3p2w_1", "label": "验收变压器", "definition": "model/CloudPSS/_newTransformer_3p2w", "canvas": "canvas_0", "args": {"Enab": "0", "Flux": "", "Gm": 0, "I1": "", "I1p": "", "I1rms": "", "I2": "", "I2p": "", "I2rms": "", "Im": "", "Im1": 0.4, "InitTap": 1, "Lead": "1", "NIM": "1", "Name": "", "P1": "", "P2": "", "Q1": "", "Q2": "", "Rl": 0, "Rn1": 0.01, "Rn2": 0.01, "Sat": "1", "Tap": "0", "Tdc": 0, "Tmva": 100, "Txk": 0, "V1": 10, "V2": 110, "Xac": 0.2, "Xknee": 1.17, "Xl": 0.1, "YD1": "0", "YD2": "1", "f": 50}, "pins": {"0": "", "1": "", "2": "", "3": "", "4": "", "5": ""}}, "after": {"key": "_newTransformer_3p2w_1", "label": "验收变压器", "definition": "model/CloudPSS/_newTransformer_3p2w", "canvas": "canvas_0", "args": {"Enab": "0", "Flux": "", "Gm": 0, "I1": "", "I1p": "", "I1rms": "", "I2": "", "I2p": "", "I2rms": "", "Im": "", "Im1": 0.4, "InitTap": 1, "Lead": "1", "NIM": "1", "Name": "", "P1": "", "P2": "", "Q1": "", "Q2": "", "Rl": 0, "Rn1": 0.01, "Rn2": 0.01, "Sat": "1", "Ta